      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Star colt LOUCASSO (7) makes his first Sydney appearance for new trainer Seaton Grima. Hasn't raced since a phenomenal juvenile season that saw him win the G1 Protostar in Brisbane along with a 25m romp in the Breeders Crown Final when last seen in December. Cruised home in a Newcastle trial so can pick up where he left off. ALERT BAY (3) added to a string of top-three results at this venue when he worked home late for third last time. Race fit and draws to be competitive. ONE MORE REASON (1) led from wider and missed narrowly when resuming. Hasn't missed a place when fresh and has the speed to be prominent from the ace draw. ETHANS REVENGE (4) and EYE CAN EAR AMOUR (6) are both exotic hopes.",
